    <DataNode elementId="MONOMER-13868" textLabel="MONOMER-13868" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="MONOMER-13868" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="701.9853515625" centerY="476.99127197265625" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="SRI, caspi">The |FRAME: G-10582 KS11| gene was cloned from |FRAME: TAX-39947 &lt;i&gt;Oryza sativa&lt;/i&gt; Japonica Group| based on its similarity to a gene encoding another diterpene cyclase, kaurene synthase. The protein was expressed and purified as a fusion to GST |CITS: [16256063]|. The enzyme is highly specific for its substrate, and produces |FRAME: MONOMER-13868 stemod-13(17)-ene synthase|, a diterpenoid that has not yet been reported to occur or to be a precursor of any secondary metabolite in rice |CITS: [16256063]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="MONOMER-13868" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-14826" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="G-10582" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <Property key="MolecularWeightKd" value="90.385" />
      <Property key="MolecularWeightSeq" value="90.385" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_16256063" />
    </DataNode>
    <DataNode elementId="CYC1-MONOMER" textLabel="CYC1-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q68CM0" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="654.016845703125" centerY="1466.198486328125" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The |FRAME: CYC1 Cyc1| gene isolated from |FRAME: TAX-4530 &lt;i&gt;Oryza sativa&lt;/i&gt;| encodes an |FRAME: CYC1-MONOMER &lt;i&gt;syn&lt;/i&gt;-copalyl diphosphate synthase| (&lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-CPD synthase) |CITS:[15341631]|. The recombinant enzyme, expressed as a GST-fusion in &lt;i&gt;E.coli&lt;/i&gt;, was shown to convert |FRAME: GERANYLGERANYL-PP all-&lt;i&gt;trans&lt;/i&gt;-geranyl-geranyl diphosphate| into |FRAME: CPD-8719 9&amp;alpha;-copalyl diphosphate|. OsCyc1 is specifically involved in phytoalexins biosynthesis |CITS:[15341631]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CYC1-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phytozome" value="Os04t0178300-03" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Modbase" value="Q68CM0" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Swissmodel" value="Q68CM0" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q68CM0" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Refseq" value="BAD42451" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-13499" />
